  "text": "**Alex:** Hey, did you see that new art exhibit downtown?\n\n**Jamie:** No, I haven\u2019t. I heard it\u2019s supposed to be really good though. What kind of art is it?\n\n**Alex:** Mostly abstract sculptures and some digital installations. The vibe is pretty intense.\n\n**Jamie:** Oh, cool. I\u2019ve been wanting to check out something different. When\u2019s it opening?\n\n**Alex:** It opens next Friday. You should come with me. I\u2019ll buy you a drink after.\n\n**Jamie:** That sounds like a plan. I\u2019ll need a reminder though\u2014my schedule is a mess these days.\n\n**Alex:** No worries, I\u2019ll text you the day before. Just don\u2019t forget to wear comfy shoes.\n\n**Jamie:** Comfy shoes? Why?\n\n**Alex:** There\u2019s a big piece in the middle that you walk through. You don\u2019t want to be tripping over your own feet.\n\n**Jamie:** Okay, fair. I\u2019ll bring my camera too. I want to take some pictures.\n\n**Alex:** That\u2019s a good idea. I\u2019ve heard the lighting is amazing. It\u2019s almost like a movie set.\n\n**Jamie:** Seriously? I might have to come early.\n\n**Alex:** Yeah, the line can get pretty long. You don\u2019t want to miss the first exhibit.\n\n**Jamie:** I\u2019ll bring snacks too. You know, just in case.\n\n**Alex:** Smart move. I\u2019ll bring my favorite bag of chips.\n\n**Jamie:** Deal. I\u2019ll see you Friday then.\n\n**Alex:** Can\u2019t wait. See you then.",
